      ":question/id": "e0f7b235-8ae9-5937-8e10-baa26e88faee",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^4\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&\\quad -2\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&\\quad +\\sin^4\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)=\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the expression in the question. Recognize the expanded perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE &= \\left(\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right)^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(x\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, square the value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE &= \\left(0\\right)^2 \\\\\n&= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    }
  },
