      ":question/id": "22b1843d-4007-53d9-ab88-b98d3616888d",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-120036",
      ":question/problem": "Find the exact value of ${(\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})-\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218}))}^{2}.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, we expand the parenthesis and use the Pythagorean identity.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})-\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218}))}^{2} & ={sin}^{2}({165}^{\u2218})-2\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218})+{cos}^{2}({165}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =[{sin}^{2}({165}^{\u2218})+{cos}^{2}({165}^{\u2218})]-2\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =1-2\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}x\\operatorname{cos}x=\\operatorname{sin}2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={165}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{sin}(2\\cdot {165}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}({330}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain\n\n$$\n1-2\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218})=1-\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{(\\operatorname{sin}({165}^{\u2218})+\\operatorname{cos}({165}^{\u2218}))}^{2}=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": []
    }
  }
